1
00:00:02,976 --> 00:00:05,088
Is this your family photo, Peter?

2
00:00:05,968 --> 00:00:07,856
Yes, it is.

3
00:00:08,304 --> 00:00:10,000
Are these your parents?

4
00:00:10,672 --> 00:00:12,224
Yes, they are.

5
00:00:13,088 --> 00:00:13,952
Who’s he?

6
00:00:14,976 --> 00:00:18,112
He’s my father’s brother, my uncle.

7
00:00:18,752 --> 00:00:20,880
And this is my aunt.

8
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,272
Who’s she?

9
00:00:22,672 --> 00:00:24,816
She’s my sister, Helen.

10
00:00:25,152 --> 00:00:26,224
Is this your brother?

11
00:00:26,448 --> 00:00:29,472
No, it’s my cousin, David.

12
00:00:30,096 --> 00:00:31,888
This is my brother, Jim.

13
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,568
Who are they?

14
00:00:33,808 --> 00:00:35,696
They’re my grandparents.

15
00:00:36,464 --> 00:00:38,544
They’re my father’s parents.

16
00:00:38,976 --> 00:00:40,528
What a happy family!

